  "label": "Meghan Markle is mapped as 'the fresh prince'",
  "description": "The text 'the fresh prince' is overlaid on the image and explicitly maps Meghan Markle (the woman with long dark hair petting the dog) to the character 'the fresh prince' from the TV show 'The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air'. This is an analogical mapping where the textual label 'the fresh prince' is applied to the visual entity Meghan Markle, implying she is an outsider or newcomer, which is a derogatory stereotype. The mapping is established through the direct juxtaposition of the text with the visual material, where the text serves to label or categorize the visual entity.",
